"text-decoration: underline; color:#0000ff;\">2.1 Homepage</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"#submitting_bugs"
